              Roland van der Veen: Def. 4 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em A smooth introduction to knots
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://www.julianlyczak.nl/seminar/knots2016-files/KnotesJan18.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/vdVeen-SmoothKnots.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p Vivid illustrations:
          %ul
