                (2022) &amp;lbrack;video:
                %a{:href => "https://youtu.be/KxEBhD0C2Pw"}> YT
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                Nadav Drukker, Elise Paznokas, Dominik Schrimpel:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Knitting Knots &amp; the Framing Anomaly
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Proceedings of Bridges 2022: Mathematics, Art, Music, Architecture, Culture
                = succeed "," do
